# Product rules

- 17 regular-season weekly picks; one NFL team per player per week; no regular-season team reuse.
- Eliminated players continue making weekly picks.
- Win = 1 point; loss or tie = 0.
- Bonuses: best record 4, longest streak 4, regular survivor winner 10; tied leaders each get the full bonus.
- One 17-0 player wins overall; multiple 17-0 players use playoff survivor as tiebreak.
- Playoffs are a separate survivor with a fresh used-team list; points 2 / 4 / 6 / 12.
- Timezone: Central Time.
- Other players’ picks stay hidden until the deadline.
- Do not guess undefined cases (missed picks, cancellations, postponements, exhausted playoff tiebreaks) — ask.
